class: negative
summary: a stray end on a body's first line is reported where it is written, with no repair written into the signature above it
program: program.ldn
codes: L0110
constructs: 1800, 1810
targets: linux-x86-64, linux-arm64, freebsd-x86-64, freebsd-arm64
args: ../tests/fixtures/negative/stray-end-before-the-first-statement/program.ldn
expect: expected.txt
status: 1
